    "net_debt_basis": "Corporate debt at 2026-06-30: long-term debt 5,731 + current maturities 69 + short-term borrowings ex-warehouse ~1,575 (ShortTermBorrowings 2,293 less warehouse lines 711 less other 7; commercial paper/revolver drawn to fund Pearce and buybacks) + finance-lease liabilities 229 = 7,604; less cash 1,489. Warehouse lines (711) excluded: they are self-liquidating funding of mortgage loans held for sale (Advisory loan servicing), matched by those loans.",
    "wacc_rationale": "USD flows, USD rate. Risk-free ~4.3% (10y UST), ERP 5.0%, beta ~1.15 -> cost of equity ~10.0%; after-tax cost of debt ~4.0% on ~16% debt weight -> ~9.0%. Single WACC across scenarios: cyclicality is charged through the bear path and weights, not a premium (risk charged once).",
